<h2>Segment 368 &mdash; four conception cases and unmistaken versus mistaken</h2>
<div class="pair">
<div class="tib"><div class="lab">TIBETAN (WYLIE)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s368S"><span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w1">bsam pa</span> la <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w2">gsum</span> las, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w3">&#x27;du shes</span> ni <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w4">bzhi</span> ste, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w5">gzhi</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w6">sems can</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s368p7">lta bu</span> la <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w8">sems can</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s368p9">du</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w10">&#x27;du shes pa</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s368f11">sems can min par</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w12">&#x27;du shes pa</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s368f13">sems can min pa</span> la <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s368f14">sems can min par</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w15">&#x27;du shes pa</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s368p16">dang</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w17">sems can</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s368p18">du</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w19">&#x27;du shes pa</span> bzhi ste, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w20">&#x27;du shes</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w21">dang po</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s368p22">dang</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w23">gsum pa</span> ni <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w24">ma &#x27;khrul ba</span> dang , <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w25">gnyis pa</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s368p26">dang</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w27">bzhi pa</span> ni <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w28">&#x27;khrul ba&#x27;o</span>,</span>
</div>
<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s368S">The part of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w1">thinking</span> has <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w2">three</span> components of its own. <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w3">Conception</span> can be of <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w4">four</span> different types: to <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w10">conceive</span> of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w5">object</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s368p7">say</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w6">living being</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s368p9">as being</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w8">living being</span>; to <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w12">conceive</span> of a living being as <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s368f11">something other than a living being</span>; to <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w15">conceive</span> of <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s368f13">something other than a living being</span> as being <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s368f14">other than a living being</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s368p16">and</span> to <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w19">conceive</span> of this same thing <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s368p18">as</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w17">living being</span>. The <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w21">first</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s368p22">and</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w23">third</span> types of <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w20">conception</span> here are <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w24">unmistaken</span>; the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w25">second</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s368p26">and</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w27">fourth</span> are <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s368w28">mistaken</span>.</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, independent English-first proposal. Distinguish all four conception verbs and their positive/negative objects and predicates. Negative living-being phrases remain whole at d3; repeated English object wording does not create extra Tibetan occurrences. Preserve the final bound sentence ending with the complete mistaken form. No null, source correction or hgm_gloss promotion.</div>
